{
  "_readme": [
    "Per-widget map used by extract.js so a session reads ONE widget, not the whole 1.9 MB file.",
    "ours.*: regions in index.html. Each region is either {start,end} (verbatim markers, sliced inside the",
    "css or script part) or {grep:[tokens]} (line ranges containing any token, +-2 lines context).",
    "jo.*: same, against _ref/jo-phase2-8958e49.html. Replace grep regions with exact markers as each",
    "review pack is built. Kinds: W01-W07 Jo live = -mb, ours = -oc; W09-W17 Jo live = plain, ours = -mb.",
    "Drivers anchor on the same banner strings: change a marker here AND in the driver AND in index.html together.",
    "A decided widget has a single `final` side (in index.html) and a `decided` date; its ours/jo sides are removed.",
    "`removed`: kinds that left the file when the widget was decided; the cmp driver ignores baseline registry rows of those kinds."
  ],
